      "text": "int classify(int code) {\n    int result = 0;\n    switch (code) {\n        case 1:\n            result += 1;\n            result *= 2;\n            break;\n        case 2:\n        case 3:\n            result -= 1;\n            result *= 3;\n            break;\n        case 4: {\n            int scratch = code;\n            result = scratch;\n            break;\n        }\n        case 5: result = 5;\n            result += 1;\n            break;\n        default:\n            result = -1;\n            break;\n    }\n    return result;\n}\n",
